# Models: only the shipped ones are baked in. Test checkpoints and versions trained on the build PC (including
# app/models/active) stay out of the image. Keep this list in step with $ShippedModelNames in
# installer/lib/Staging.psm1; installer/tests/GpuDockerignore.Tests.ps1 checks that they match.
